sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Worker
  participant C as Control PostgreSQL
  participant R as Downstream
  W->>C: Claim with lease token, SKIP LOCKED
  C-->>W: Stable intent ID and attempt
  alt Outcome already uncertain
    W->>R: Look up original effect ID
    R-->>W: Receipt or authoritative absence
  end
  alt Matching receipt exists
    W->>C: Fence token and acknowledge historical fact
  else No receipt
    W->>C: Lock customer and recheck revision, policy, approval
    C-->>W: Commit immutable mutation and uncertainty
    W->>R: POST same ID and same payload
    R->>R: Atomic effect + unique receipt
    R-->>W: Receipt and payload hash
    W->>C: Fence token and finalize
  end
